From: ospz port <ospz@local>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:59:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] save_spz v4 (header+TOC+ZSTD streams) + round-trip test

Implement the missing SPZ v4 save path:

  pack_gaussians → core attribute streams → sequential ZSTD compress
  → NgspFileHeader + TOC + compressed frames → []u8 / file

Public API:
  save_spz_to_bytes(cloud, Pack_Options) → ([]u8, Spz_Error)
  save_spz_to_file(cloud, Pack_Options, path) → Spz_Error

No extension ILVs / frames yet (empty extension zone, FLAG_HAS_EXTENSIONS
clear). Legacy gzip save (version < 4) is not implemented in this patch.

Also adds tests/save_roundtrip_test.odin: pack → save → load → unpack
and compare attributes within quantization tolerances.
